# Revisions to skip when running `git blame`.
#
# Add the full 40-character SHA of any commit that only reformats code
# (a Biome/rustfmt sweep, a mass rename, a licence-header insertion) so that
# blame keeps pointing at the commit that last changed the logic.
#
# Enable locally with:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Example:
# 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000  # style: format entire workspace
